---
interface Props {
  lang: 'ar' | 'en';
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
---

<figure class="diagram-figure" aria-label={lang === 'ar' ? 'مخطط استعلام خوادم الأسماء والـDNS' : 'DNS lookup and recursive resolution diagram'}>
  <div class="diagram-header">
    <span class="diagram-tag">
      {lang === 'ar' ? 'مخطط 01 / مسار التحليل' : 'DIAGRAM 01 / RESOLUTION PATH'}
    </span>
    <span>
      {lang === 'ar' ? 'من الذاكرة المحلية إلى خوادم الأسماء المعتمدة' : 'From Local Caches to Authoritative Nameservers'}
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="diagram-svg-container">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 820 280" width="100%" height="auto" style="min-width: 640px; display: block;" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="dns-hatch" width="6" height="6" patternTransform="rotate(45 0 0)" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="6" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-opacity="0.12" />
        </pattern>
        <pattern id="dns-olive-hatch" width="6" height="6" patternTransform="rotate(45 0 0)" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <line x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="6" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
        </pattern>
        <marker id="dns-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#151515" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="dns-arrow-olive" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9 z" fill="#5F6849" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Frame -->
      <rect x="8" y="8" width="804" height="264" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
      <line x1="8" y1="24" x2="8" y2="8" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="8" y1="8" x2="24" y2="8" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="812" y1="256" x2="812" y2="272" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />
      <line x1="812" y1="272" x2="796" y2="272" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="2" />

      <!-- Step 1: Local Device & Stub Resolver -->
      <g transform="translate(24, 35)">
        <rect width="160" height="195" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <rect width="160" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="12" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">01 / STUB RESOLVER &amp; CACHE</text>
        <text x="12" y="44" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">CLIENT LOOKUP</text>
        <line x1="12" y1="50" x2="148" y2="50" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
        <rect x="12" y="58" width="136" height="20" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="18" y="72" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.2" fill="#151515">• Browser Cache (TTL)</text>
        <rect x="12" y="82" width="136" height="20" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="18" y="96" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.2" fill="#151515">• OS Resolver Cache</text>
        <rect x="12" y="106" width="136" height="20" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="18" y="120" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.2" fill="#151515">• Hosts File (/etc/hosts)</text>
        <rect x="12" y="132" width="136" height="42" fill="url(#dns-hatch)" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-opacity="0.4" />
        <text x="18" y="148" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.2" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">OS STUB RESOLVER</text>
        <text x="18" y="162" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="6.5" fill="#5F5D56">getaddrinfo() query</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 1 -> 2: Transport (UDP 53 or DoH/DoT transport) -->
      <path d="M 184 100 L 255 100" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#dns-arrow)" />
      <rect x="188" y="78" width="64" height="22" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.6" />
      <text x="191" y="88" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="6.8" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">UDP 53</text>
      <text x="191" y="97" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="5.8" fill="#5F5D56">or DoH/DoT</text>

      <!-- Step 2: Recursive Resolver -->
      <g transform="translate(260, 35)">
        <rect width="190" height="195" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.5" />
        <rect width="190" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="12" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">02 / RECURSIVE RESOLVER</text>
        <text x="12" y="44" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#5F6849">ISP / 1.1.1.1 / 8.8.8.8</text>
        <line x1="12" y1="50" x2="178" y2="50" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.5" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
        <rect x="12" y="58" width="166" height="34" fill="url(#dns-olive-hatch)" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="18" y="72" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#5F6849">RESOLVER CACHE HIT?</text>
        <text x="18" y="85" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5" fill="#151515">Returns IP immediately</text>
        <rect x="12" y="98" width="166" height="78" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="18" y="114" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">ON CACHE MISS TRAVERSAL:</text>
        <text x="18" y="128" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7" fill="#5F5D56">1. Query Root (.) Server</text>
        <text x="18" y="142" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7" fill="#5F5D56">2. Query TLD (.com) Server</text>
        <text x="18" y="156" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7" fill="#5F5D56">3. Query Authoritative NS</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Arrow 2 -> 3: Delegation -->
      <path d="M 450 135 L 525 135" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#dns-arrow)" />
      <rect x="460" y="120" width="55" height="14" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.6" />
      <text x="463" y="130" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7" fill="#151515">Delegation</text>

      <!-- Step 3: Authoritative Hierarchy -->
      <g transform="translate(530, 35)">
        <rect width="265" height="195" fill="#F4F1E9" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.4" />
        <rect width="265" height="24" fill="#EBE7DE" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1" />
        <text x="12" y="16" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700" fill="#151515">03 / AUTHORITATIVE INFRASTRUCTURE</text>
        
        <rect x="12" y="38" width="240" height="26" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="0.8" />
        <text x="20" y="54" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F5D56">Root (.) &amp; TLD (.com) Servers</text>

        <rect x="12" y="72" width="240" height="52" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="20" y="88" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8" font-weight="700" fill="#5F6849">AUTHORITATIVE NAMESERVER</text>
        <text x="20" y="102" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#151515">Holds DNS zone records</text>
        <text x="20" y="116" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" fill="#5F5D56">Cloudflare / Route53 / BIND</text>

        <!-- Result Box (Resolved A/AAAA record) -->
        <rect x="12" y="134" width="240" height="46" fill="#FAF8F2" stroke="#151515" stroke-width="1.2" />
        <text x="20" y="149" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7.5" font-weight="600" fill="#151515">DNS RESPONSE (A / AAAA)</text>
        <text x="20" y="165" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700" fill="#5F6849">93.184.216.34 (TTL: 300)</text>
      </g>

      <!-- Return Arrow: Direct from Resolver back to Client -->
      <path d="M 260 175 L 184 175" stroke="#5F6849" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" marker-end="url(#dns-arrow-olive)" />
      <text x="195" y="190" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="7" font-weight="600" fill="#5F6849">IP Result</text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption class="diagram-caption">
    {lang === 'ar'
      ? 'الشكل 01: مسار استعلام الـDNS — فحص ذاكرة المتصفح والنظام أولاً؛ عند عدم وجود النتيجة يقوم محلل العميل البسيط (Stub Resolver) بإرسال الاستعلام إلى المحلل التكراري (عبر UDP 53 أو وسائط مشفرة مثل DoH/DoT كخيار نقل). في حال عدم توفر النتيجة في كاش المحلل، يتم استعلام البنية التحتية الهرمية (الجذر، نطاق المستوى الأعلى، خادم الأسماء المعتمد).'
      : 'Figure 01: The DNS resolution path — checking browser and OS caches first. On cache miss, the client stub resolver queries the recursive resolver (via UDP 53 or encrypted transports like DoH/DoT). If the recursive resolver has a cache miss, it iterates through Root, TLD, and Authoritative infrastructure.'}
  </figcaption>
</figure>
